{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-04/1061419/block/singleImage/3254687/df/01KN8J60WM45XZAHZAX361TKQV.jpg?updatedAt=1793530222\"/><figcaption>受傷警員送往博愛醫院治理。</figcaption></figure><p>元朗有人狂亂駕駛。今日(1日)早上9時許，新界北交通執行及管制組人員在元龍街巡邏期間，發現一輛私家車懷疑未有遵守交通指示，遂上前截查。惟司機拒絕合作並駕車逃去，警方立即追截。</p><p>其後一名警員在朗河路尋獲涉事私家車，惟司機再次逃去，警員被車輛擦過，腳部受傷，清醒送往博愛醫院治理。案件列作「狂亂駕駛」，警方正追緝涉事司機下落，由元朗警區刑事調查隊第三隊跟進。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T01:26:19.405368+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":191,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T10:50:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T12:18:12.802635+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T01:20:49.736240+00:00","content_hash":"5cbfe9aacc0e5113dc212538de37b7dca2b0d2138b7ddf56f7c42939dc6b1102","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T01:26:19.405368+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}